  "body": "This is a security release updating Go toolchain to address recent vulnerability findings.\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n* 79b189b4695ab2f404a8a7ac3f9e1f0ea67dcf71: Fix zizmor action pin comments (@kpumuk)\r\n* ad7062d3b010a4fdc282ea39f9dcff1b937284ad: Align scorecards SARIF upload pin (@kpumuk)\r\n* c11f10317494a91ada9e6d6a01f5560b9d274fb7: Fix checkout pin version comments (@kpumuk)\r\n* 9a9e08a47fdb9a35035d2d14777bb331610c217e: Update Go toolchain to 1.26.4 (@kpumuk)\r\n* 860669388bf003cc7e5eef440f7b5b357ad738f6: Fix workflow action pin comments (@kpumuk)\r\n* 963fbef91ca8a734056996e10a4b0c4d9c5c0ec6: Update release attestation action and group CodeQL updates (@kpumuk)\r\n* 3aeec112731f88dd46089c04e431e1805a56ebe2: Bump Go to 1.26.5 (@kpumuk)\r\n* f0a468f9cbf76060f995f4759fe67c9398439311: Upgrade Go toolchain to 1.27 (@kpumuk)\r\n\r\n",
